EmergencyCoordinator --> UC19
EmergencyCoordinator --> UC20
EmergencyCoordinator --> UC21
EmergencyCoordinator --> UC22
EmergencyCoordinator --> UC23
EmergencyCoordinator --> UC24

' 6. Volunteer Coordinator (and Volunteer Workspace) Associations
VolunteerCoordinator --> UC02
VolunteerCoordinator --> UC01
