VolunteerCoordinator --> UC52
VolunteerCoordinator --> UC53
VolunteerCoordinator --> UC54
VolunteerCoordinator --> UC55
VolunteerCoordinator --> UC56
VolunteerCoordinator --> UC31
VolunteerCoordinator --> UC23

' 7. Shelter Administrator Associations
ShelterAdmin --> UC01
ShelterAdmin --> UC04
ShelterAdmin --> UC48
ShelterAdmin --> UC49
ShelterAdmin --> UC50
ShelterAdmin --> UC51

' 8. Resource Manager Associations
ResourceManager --> UC01
ResourceManager --> UC04
ResourceManager --> UC43
ResourceManager --> UC44
ResourceManager --> UC45
ResourceManager --> UC46
ResourceManager --> UC47

' 9. Funding Officer Associations
FundingOfficer --> UC01
