FundingOfficer --> UC33
FundingOfficer --> UC34
FundingOfficer --> UC35
FundingOfficer --> UC36

' 10. External Systems Associations
UC23 --> GeminiAPI : Structured JSON\nInference
UC31 --> GeminiAPI : Contextual Chat\nCompletion
UC02 --> SmtpService : Welcome Email
UC03 --> SmtpService : Pending Review &\nAdmin Alert Email
UC07 --> SmtpService : 24h Single-Use\nSetup Link Email
UC10 --> SmtpService : Approval / Rejection\nNotification Email

footer CareLink Humanitarian Aid & Crisis Management Platform | Verified Implementation UML Use Case Model (9 Primary Actors, 2 External Systems, 56 Use Cases)
@enduml
